OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main disrupts race
OL,4,Atraffic
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlooding caused by a burst water main
OL,7,Fhas disrupted Great North Run traffic.
OL,9,FNorthumbrian Water said there was a
OL,10,F"heavy burst on a water main" at the
OL,11,Fgrassed bank on the side of Askew Road
OL,12,Fin Gateshead, which saw water flood on
OL,13,Fto the roundabout near the A189
OL,14,FRedheugh Bridge.
OL,16,FTens of thousands of people were making
OL,17,Ftheir way into Newcastle for the Great
OL,18,FNorth Run, which sees runners take on a
OL,19,Fhalf marathon through Gateshead before
OL,20,Fending in South Shields.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
