OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main disrupts race
OL,4,Atraffic
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actual route is not disrupted, but
OL,7,Fthere were closures on parts of the
OL,8,FA184 in Gateshead and diversions in
OL,9,Fplace.
